{"text":{"en":{"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>링크 볼·L볼</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 제조사·형번 체계가 서로 다른 <strong>링크 볼</strong>(당사 SWS 카탈로그)과 <strong>L볼</strong>(당사 IKO 카탈로그)을 용도가 같아 한 곳에 모았습니다. 아래에서 계열을 선택하면 형번별 상세 규격을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>Link Balls · L-Balls</h2> <p>A spherical joint combining a ball stud with a socket-type seat, used at the connections of linkage mechanisms where linear and oscillating motion occur together. We have gathered <strong>Link Balls</strong>(our SWS catalog) and <strong>L-Balls</strong>(our IKO catalog), which use different manufacturer and model numbering systems, in one place because they serve the same purpose. Select a series below to see detailed specifications by model number.</p>","링크 볼 (당사 SWS 카탈로그)":"Link Balls (our SWS catalog)","<a class=\"product-card\" href=\"link_ball_zbl.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"18\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"27\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></svg> <h4>ZBL(RBL) 시리즈</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"link_ball_rbi.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"18\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"27\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></svg> <h4>RBI 시리즈</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a>":"<a class=\"product-card\" href=\"link_ball_zbl.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"18\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"27\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></svg> <h4>ZBL(RBL) Series</h4> <span 